3. How a Browser Requests and Displays a Web Page?
    >User enters a website URL. 
    >Browser sends an HTTP/HTTPS request to the web server. 
    >The web server receives the request. 
    >If needed, the server retrieves data from the database. 
    >The server sends HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and images back to the browser. 
    >The browser renders the page and displays it to the user. 

