8. Difference Between Static and Dynamic Websites
Static Website	Dynamic Website
Fixed content	Content changes dynamically
HTML and CSS only	Uses server-side languages and databases
Faster	More interactive
No database	Database connected
Examples
Static Website
•	Personal portfolio 
•	Company information page 
Dynamic Website
•	Facebook 
•	Amazon 
•	Online banking websites

